edits.prompt:
Use case: text-localization / infographic-diagram. Edit target: supplied web vocabulary infographic. Patch it to fit Unit 02 of the beginner medical workshop. Keep friendly cream/navy blue-teal-orange illustrative style and landscape 3:2, rounded panels and student/robot characters. Remove old "04" heading prefix. Title "醫事工具網頁：檔案與操作"; subtitle "先知道各部分負責什麼，不必背程式語法".
Use six concise cards around a central browser mockup of "我的專業工具練習":
"靜態網頁 APP" / "瀏覽器裡可操作的小工具";
"HTML · index.html" / "內容：用途、欄位、按鈕、教學圖";
"CSS · styles.css" / "外觀：字體、顏色、手機版面";
"JavaScript · script.js" / "操作：勾選後更新完成數量";
"Prompt 與 AI Agent" / "說清楚需求，協助製作與修改";
"notes.md 與 assets/" / "保存需求、測試紀錄與教學圖".
Central mockup should show an ordinary student preparation page, not a generic number-pad calculator: heading "我的專業工具練習", a small optometry lens diagram and dilution formula illustration, three checkboxes labelled "確認需求" "手算案例" "準備教學圖", exactly two checked and the third unchecked, and count "已完成 2／3". Use clean schematic icons, no patient imagery or clinical recommendations.
Arrows connect content/style/interaction to central browser; illustration of student trying the checklist and robot at laptop. Bottom footer "靜態網頁也可以互動；保存整個資料夾，再開啟與檢查。" and small note "外觀與操作也可以放在同一個 HTML 檔案。".
All explanatory text Traditional Chinese. Large readable type and uncluttered layout, exact filenames and correct checkbox count, no shop goods, no unnecessary section numbers.
